(6854981, 1032229, 60862, '<td valign="top">Hmm.  Looks like you have some masking or brush mark problems.  I could accept that it''s deliberate around the moon, but the bluish mark to the right out where it should be black looks very off, and the black smudgy area below and to the left of the receipt does, too.<br/> <br/>A nice concept, though.</td>', 'Hmm.  Looks like you have some masking or brush mark problems.  I could accept that it''s deliberate around the moon, but the bluish mark to the right out where it should be black looks very off, and the black smudgy area below and to the left of the receipt does, too. A nice concept, though.', '2012-09-03 01:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
