(6855370, 1032186, 117534, '<td valign="top">I had my entry processed just like this, and then I tossed it and tried another for fear someone would say ... Overprocessed... now mine is sucking hind tail LOL so I wish I''d have stayed right here, although we wouldn''ve had two darn near the same shots! LOL soooo I have to score you big and hope you do well!!!</td>', 'I had my entry processed just like this, and then I tossed it and tried another for fear someone would say ... Overprocessed... now mine is sucking hind tail LOL so I wish I''d have stayed right here, although we wouldn''ve had two darn near the same shots! LOL soooo I have to score you big and hope you do well!!!', '2012-09-03 14:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
