(6855379, 1032262, 117534, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo, in my humble opinion the only thing I would''ve done diff is I think the moon needs toned a bit since the sky is so blue and purple.. But, what do I know my shot is getting hammered and I thought it was pretty... Sooo that''s just my thought good luck and I''m giving this a 7</td>', 'Lovely photo, in my humble opinion the only thing I would''ve done diff is I think the moon needs toned a bit since the sky is so blue and purple.. But, what do I know my shot is getting hammered and I thought it was pretty... Sooo that''s just my thought good luck and I''m giving this a 7', '2012-09-03 14:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
