(6857495, 1032263, 108982, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea and I like everything with one technical thing. In order for the Earth to be in a state of ''Fullness'' as in a full moon the shadows cast on the moon would at a minimum be generally toward the earth because to portray fullness the reflective line of sight would be toward the earth.  That being said 6 for the capture and Idea and +1 for homage to Niel Armstrong 7</td>', 'This is a great idea and I like everything with one technical thing. In order for the Earth to be in a state of ''Fullness'' as in a full moon the shadows cast on the moon would at a minimum be generally toward the earth because to portray fullness the reflective line of sight would be toward the earth.  That being said 6 for the capture and Idea and +1 for homage to Niel Armstrong 7', '2012-09-05 21:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
