(6860956, 1032285, 114969, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mqnaufal:</b></div><hr/><i> Fantastic one and well deserved crown! I would love to read Post-processing tutorial on this. I know I am asking for too much. :)<br/> <br/>Congrats buddy! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you very much :-)<br/>A complete tutorial would be very long to write and I unfortunately can''t afford that time, but I made the PSD file available (added the link at the end of my notes). Just disable all the groups, then enable them one by one to see how that was constructed. It should be quite easy to follow, but you can always PM me for some information if needed.</td>', 'Originally posted by mqnaufal: Fantastic one and well deserved crown! I would love to read Post-processing tutorial on this. I know I am asking for too much. :) Congrats buddy!   Thank you very much :-)A complete tutorial would be very long to write and I unfortunately can''t afford that time, but I made the PSD file available (added the link at the end of my notes). Just disable all the groups, then enable them one by one to see how that was constructed. It should be quite easy to follow, but you can always PM me for some information if needed.', '2012-09-10 06:31:02.000000', NULL, 0),
