(6861068, 1032285, 124815, '<td valign="top">Christophe, your notes start with:<br/><i>For this entry, I decided to create something simple, for a change</i> <br/>You said it all. The one time where "less is more" truly applies. You created a strong image, still a photograph, with a clear focal point, a splendid atmosphere, a great economy in details. Expert editing but not a book illustration where the medium does really not count. <br/> <br/>I liked your photos before you got immersed in photoshop which took over the photography. <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=901323" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1248/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_901323.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1248/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_901323.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1248/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_901323.jpg"/></a> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=884312" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1214/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_884312.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1214/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_884312.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1214/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_884312.jpg"/></a> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=901126" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1246/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_901126.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1246/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_901126.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1246/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_901126.jpg"/></a> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=904083" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1255/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_904083.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1255/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_904083.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1255/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_904083.jpg"/></a> <br/>This photo gave me the feeling that you were going into the direction of illustration:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=872877" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1201/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_872877.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1201/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_872877.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1201/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_872877.jpg"/></a>. The majestic, sometimes aloof Mont Saint Michel became the princess castle. <br/> <br/>This is the reason why I do not mark your shots. I commend you for the photoshop technique, your extraordinary diligence , the perseverance and enthusiasm and wish that you''ll develop more and into different directions. Sometimes the cheers of an audience makes one stuck to one road while there are so many other possibilities.<br/>Keep exploring!</td>', 'Christophe, your notes start with:For this entry, I decided to create something simple, for a change You said it all. The one time where "less is more" truly applies. You created a strong image, still a photograph, with a clear focal point, a splendid atmosphere, a great economy in details. Expert editing but not a book illustration where the medium does really not count.  I liked your photos before you got immersed in photoshop which took over the photography.     This photo gave me the feeling that you were going into the direction of illustration:. The majestic, sometimes aloof Mont Saint Michel became the princess castle.  This is the reason why I do not mark your shots. I commend you for the photoshop technique, your extraordinary diligence , the perseverance and enthusiasm and wish that you''ll develop more and into different directions. Sometimes the cheers of an audience makes one stuck to one road while there are so many other possibilities.Keep exploring!', '2012-09-10 11:44:24.000000', NULL, 0),
